1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,667
THE SKY IS TURNING BLACK… AND THE MOUNTAIN IS EXPLODING!

2
00:00:02,907 --> 00:00:03,804
WHAT IS HAPPENING?!

3
00:00:04,124 --> 00:00:07,307
I was walking through Pompeii in the year 79 AD.

4
00:00:07,547 --> 00:00:10,786
People were shopping, talking, and enjoying an ordinary day.

5
00:00:11,904 --> 00:00:13,000
Then suddenly… Mount Vesuvius erupted!

6
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:16,439
A giant cloud of ash shot into the sky.

7
00:00:18,304 --> 00:00:19,578
People started running.

8
00:00:19,818 --> 00:00:22,218
Ash covered the streets, buildings, and rooftops.

9
00:00:22,458 --> 00:00:24,880
Nobody understood how dangerous it was.

10
00:00:26,204 --> 00:00:30,745
I looked up… and realized the entire city was disappearing beneath volcanic ash!

11
00:00:32,154 --> 00:00:35,182
I tried to escape, but everything around me was turning dark.

12
00:00:35,422 --> 00:00:37,747
Pompeii would remain buried for centuries.

13
00:00:38,204 --> 00:00:39,416
And the craziest part?

14
00:00:39,656 --> 00:00:43,015
Almost 2,000 years later, people would discover this lost city!

15
00:00:43,255 --> 00:00:44,696
SUBSCRIBE TO HISTORY WORLD!
